# The gate's own Ed25519 signing key. Generated on first boot, persisted so a
# restart does not invalidate headroom envelopes a merchant is already holding
# — and never committed. It was, for 25 commits, in a public repo. It is a demo
# key and it still should not have been there: the loader chmods it 0600, which
# is pointless if the same bytes are in the history.
fixtures/keys/gate_signing_key.hex
*_signing_key.hex

